{
  "sourceLanguage" : "zh-Hans",
  "strings" : {
    "%1$@ · %2$@卡" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@・%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$@ · 累计 %2$lld 次%3$@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@・%3$@ 通算%2$lld回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$@ 陪你举铁，待满 30 分钟算一次健身，得 %2$lld 个能量罐。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@も一緒に筋トレ。30分いたらジム1回として、缶%2$lld個。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$lld 条 · 决策 %2$lld 条" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld件・判断 %2$lld件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$lld 次%2$@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%2$@ %1$lld回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$lld 次判断 · 纠正 %2$lld 次" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "判断%1$lld回・訂正%2$lld回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%1$lld 能量罐 · 还差 %2$lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$lld缶・あと%2$lld缶"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · 手动" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@・手動"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · 手表" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@・ウォッチ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · 还没有模式" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ · No mode yet"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@・モードなし"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 从睡觉时间开始变困，一直到起床时间。打开提醒，到点发一条通知，只提醒一次。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@は寝る時間から起きる時間まで眠そうにしています。通知をオンにすると、その時間に1回だけ通知します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ 已经在打哈欠了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ is already yawning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@的地方" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@の場所"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 次判断" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "判断%lld回"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 能量罐 换" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld缶で交換"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "HAKU 会留在家里，他的罐子和东西都在。KURO 用她自己的罐子，第一次从零开始。随时可以换回来。" : {
      "comment" : "设置：换角色前的确认",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HAKU stays home with his cans and things. KURO uses her own cans, starting from zero the first time. You can switch back anytime."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HAKUは家に残ります。缶も持ち物もそのまま。KUROは自分の缶を使い、最初はゼロから。いつでも戻せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KURO 会留在家里，她的罐子和东西都在。HAKU 用他自己的罐子，第一次从零开始。随时可以换回来。" : {
      "comment" : "设置：换角色前的确认",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KURO stays home with her cans and things. HAKU uses his own cans, starting from zero the first time. You can switch back anytime."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "KUROは家に残ります。缶も持ち物もそのまま。HAKUは自分の缶を使い、最初はゼロから。いつでも戻せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "M月d日 EEE" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "M月d日(EEE)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Time 没打开：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Screen Timeがオンになっていません：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Time 监测没停：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Screen Time tracking didn't stop: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Time 监测没启动：%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Screen Time tracking didn't start: %@"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Screen Timeの監視を開始できませんでした：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\\n\\n决策记录（%lld 条）\\n" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "\n\n判断の記録（%lld件）\n"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 最多同时看 %lld 个地点，删掉一个才能再加。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOSが同時に見られる場所は%lld件までです。追加するには1つ削除してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……你好。你平时一天都怎么过？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……はじめまして。ふだん、どう過ごしてる？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……好，那就看你去哪儿。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……行き先で決める。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……就这样。以后慢慢来。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……これで。あとはゆっくり。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……就这样吧。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……こんなもんか。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……新来的？你平时一天都在干嘛？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……新入り？\nふだん何してんの？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……行，那我不管时间了。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……時間は無視。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……这样可以吗？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……これで、どう？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……这样？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……こんな感じ？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "……随便看看，不急。" : {
      "comment" : "第二个预设角色",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "…just looking. no rush."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "……ゆっくり見てって。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「健身」从下班里拿出来，放进这张卡了。一件事只放一张卡。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「筋トレ」はオフから外して、このカードに入れました。ひとつのことはカード1枚にだけ入ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "月"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一天最多找你一次。早上不吵你。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "声かけるのは1日1回まで。\n朝は静かにしてる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一天最多跟你说一次话，早上不打扰。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "話しかけるのは1日1回まで。朝はそっとしとく。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一般几点睡呀？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "いつも何時に寝る？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一般几点睡？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "だいたい何時に寝る？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "三" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "水"
          }
        }
