    "下班" : {
      "comment" : "同一中文要两种译法（见上一行），请工程把中文改得稍有不同",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "End"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下班以后会做什么？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仕事のあとは、なにしてる？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下班以后呢？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仕事のあとは？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下班以后还在弄自己的事吗？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仕事のあとも、自分のことやってる？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下班前 15 分钟提醒一次，只在你上班的日子。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "終業15分前に1回だけ通知します。仕事の日だけです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不切换" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Don't switch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不切换，用来看你是不是窝在家。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Doesn't switch. Used to tell if you're holed up at home."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切り替えません。家でくつろいでいるかを見るために使います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不固定" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不規則"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不固定的话，上班只靠到了上班的地方来切，也不发下班提醒。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不規則なら、「仕事」は職場に着いたときだけ切り替わります。終業前の通知もありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不用" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使わない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "之后都能在设置里改。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あとで全部、設定で変えられます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "二" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "火"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "五" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "金"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "人在哪儿就点哪儿。没有地图，位置只存在这台手机上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "いまいる場所をタップ。地図は使いません。位置情報はこのiPhoneにだけ保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "人生收藏" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Life collection"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "人生コレクション"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "人站在这个地点时点「设为当前位置」。范围是进出算到达和离开的距离。只存在这台 iPhone 上。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stand at the place and tap “Use current location.” The radius is how far counts as arriving and leaving. Stays on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "その場所にいるときに「現在地に設定」をタップ。範囲は、着いた・離れたと判断する距離です。このiPhoneにだけ保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天还没切过 mode。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No mode switches yet today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从你去的日子学的" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Learned from the days you went"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "行った日から覚えた"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从你的记录里自己记下的，只能看。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noted from your records. View only."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "記録から自動で覚えたものです。見るだけです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "他" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "彼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以后再说" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あとで"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以后可以换，各自的东西分开存。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "あとで変えられます。持ち物はキャラクターごとに別です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "位置" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Location"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "位置权限不是「始终」：App 关着时不知道你到了或离开公司、家。到 设置 > Life Hub > 位置 选「始终」" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Location isn't set to “Always,” so with the app closed it can't tell when you reach or leave the office or home. Go to Settings > Life Hub > Location and pick “Always.”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你到了哪里，我就跟着换样子。可以让我知道你在哪吗？" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "行った場所で、私も格好を変える。場所、教えてくれる？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你到公司、回家，我自己换衣服。要知道你在哪。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会社と家、着いたら俺が着替える。だから場所がいる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你在走路还是坐车，我想跟着一起。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "歩きか乗り物か。\n一緒に合わせたい。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的三张卡" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カードは3枚"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的四张卡" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カードは4枚"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你睡得好不好、有没有动一动，我想知道。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "よく眠れたか、体を動かしたか。知りたい。"
